  <div id="sutta">
  
                <h3 id="AN10.13" class="h1">Fetters<br/>
                  Saṁyojana Sutta  (AN 10:13)</h3><!--end suttahead-->
                <p>“There are these ten fetters. Which ten? Five lower fetters &amp; five higher fetters. And which are the five lower fetters? Self-identification views, uncertainty, grasping at habits &amp; practices, sensual desire, &amp; ill will. These are the five lower fetters. And which are the five higher fetters? Passion for form, passion for what is formless, conceit, restlessness, &amp; ignorance. These are the five higher fetters. And these are the ten fetters.”</p>
                <p class="seealso">See also: <a href="../SN/SN1_25.html">SN 1:25</a>; <a href="../SN/SN12_68.html">SN 12:68</a>; <a href="../SN/SN22_89.html">SN 22:89</a>; <a href="AN3_88.html">AN 3:88</a>; <a href="AN4_131.html">AN 4:131</a>; <a href="AN6_49.html">AN 6:49</a>; <a href="AN7_48.html">AN 7:48</a></p><!--end seealso-->
